    "source1": "https://help.aliyun.com/zh/emr/emr-on-ecs/product-overview/emr-on-ecs-release-version/ (\"各版本支持的组件\" section) for application/component versions.",
    "source2": "https://help.aliyun.com/zh/emr/emr-on-ecs/product-overview/lifecycle-policies-for-emr-on-ecs (\"存量发行版本与生命周期时间点的对应关系\" section) for GA/EOM/EOS dates.",
    "releaseGranularity": "Alibaba Cloud EMR groups patch releases under one minor-version label (e.g. \"EMR-5.20.x\" covers all 5.20.x patches); there is no finer per-patch table like AWS EMR.",
    "lifecycleCoverageGap": "The lifecycle page is updated on a slower cadence than the component-version page, so the newest 1-2 releases in each series (e.g. EMR-5.19.x, EMR-5.20.x, EMR-3.53.x, EMR-3.54.x as of this writing) have no GA/EOM/EOS dates yet (null in releaseLifecycle) even though their component versions are already published.",
    "retiredSeriesLifecycle": "Very old series (1.x.x, 2.x.x, and the earliest 3.x/4.x/5.x ranges) are already past EOS and have no component-version data left on the release-version page; their lifecycle dates are kept here as a historical record instead of under releaseLifecycle."
